        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" 4 Wire Electric Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty 4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" (4) wire electric transfer commercial  door hinge with ball bearings and Non-Removable Pin.  28 gauge wires rated 3.5 amps. UL Fire Listed and tested to over 100,000 cycles.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a  Non-Removable Pin (NRP) for security.\r\n Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the PDQ 35STBB4545626EL4 Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Electrical Wires: (4) 28 gauge wires</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>2 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Hinge Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed for Fire Doors</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Conforms to ANSI A8111</li>\r\n<li> Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish: Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Warranty: Five (5) year manufacture warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with machine screws and wood screws. For use with metal or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
